## Fleet standing rules (all machines)

- Files are the single source of truth for critical state; chat carries discussion and doorbells, never state.
- No installs or removals on any machine without the owner's explicit per-machine permission.
- Keys, tokens, and auth material never leave the machine they belong to, and never land in a project folder or on the shelf (Dropbox).
